# What a build context never needs. The image is built from a clean checkout: nothing local goes into it, and
# above all no environment file (a secret baked into an image is a secret in every copy of it).
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
# Runtime data only, as .gitignore has it: a bare **/data would also drop source folders named data (app/data).
**/data/s3
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-journal
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
CURRENT_TASK*.md
.claude
.agents
docs
contracts
